            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Agenda 0.4.0

- Adds a privacy-safe agent integration pack for Cursor and Claude Code,
  available from **Settings → Reveal Agent Integration Pack…**.
- Adds related-todo search guidance and portable pickup/closeout rules while
  preserving human ownership of task status and review decisions.
- Publishes the agent pack as a separate ZIP beside the Agenda DMG.
- Moves bug reports to the public Agenda release tracker without attaching
  local server logs automatically.
]]></description>
